I have a problem with my code. I wrote a program that takes a string from the user and adds a prefix and a suffix to it. The prefix and suffix are entered by the user. The problem is that the output of the program does not match the output that is expected. The output I get is "Hello my name is Houssem". The output I want is "Hello, my name is Houssem". I have attached the code below, please help me fix it. Thank you.

#include <stdio.h>

 int main()
{
    char name[20];
    char prefix[20];
    char suffix[20];
    printf("Enter your name: ");
    scanf("%s", &name);
    printf("Enter the prefix you want: ");
    scanf("%s", &prefix);
    printf("Enter the suffix you want: ");
    scanf("%s", &suffix);
    printf("Hello, my name is %s\n", prefix, name, suffix);
    return 0;
}
